[
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_qin_haoxuan_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "一拳打在慕容超的脸上",
    "start_offset": 873,
    "end_offset": 883,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_qin_haoxuan_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "考虑到明天是最终测试，秦浩轩强行按捺住前去绝仙毒谷寻宝的冲动",
    "start_offset": 1502,
    "end_offset": 1532,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_zhang_kuang_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "对秦浩轩一来就得罪了三皇子李靖，张狂有些幸灾乐祸",
    "start_offset": 1463,
    "end_offset": 1487,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_zhang_yang_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "明鉴仙眼】顿时闪起灰色光芒",
    "start_offset": 2332,
    "end_offset": 2345,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_li_jing_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "在他的眼神示意下，他身边那几名权贵子弟也大摇大摆出去抢被子",
    "start_offset": 642,
    "end_offset": 671,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_li_jing_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "放肆，谁让你们打扰秦兄弟休息的？",
    "start_offset": 1057,
    "end_offset": 1073,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_xu_yu_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "秦浩轩拉着在寒冷中蜷缩成一团的徐羽，将自己的被子分一半给他盖着",
    "start_offset": 394,
    "end_offset": 425,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_murong_chao_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "那个叫慕容超的权贵少年，抓住秦浩轩的被子一抽",
    "start_offset": 767,
    "end_offset": 789,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_murong_chao_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "慕容超出身将门，自幼习武，学的都是军中搏杀术",
    "start_offset": 969,
    "end_offset": 991,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_murong_chao_03",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "从腰间拔出一柄匕首刺向秦浩轩",
    "start_offset": 1147,
    "end_offset": 1161,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_huanglong_zhenren_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "他就是太初教掌教黄龙真人",
    "start_offset": 1739,
    "end_offset": 1751,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_huanglong_zhenren_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "当今掌教，曾经测试仙种时，也是灰种",
    "start_offset": 2508,
    "end_offset": 2525,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_luoye_zhenren_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "落叶真人还是掌教黄龙真人的师叔，在太初教辈分极高",
    "start_offset": 1932,
    "end_offset": 1956,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_luoye_zhenren_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "仙种依据强弱分为有色仙种和无色仙种",
    "start_offset": 2021,
    "end_offset": 2038,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_guyunzi_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "那古云子在这里感谢了",
    "start_offset": 2901,
    "end_offset": 2911,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_guyunzi_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "我们古云堂这一脉一直没有收徒",
    "start_offset": 2672,
    "end_offset": 2686,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_xiayunzi_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "夏云子师兄，你们夏云堂这十年来，每次有人入门都被你抢",
    "start_offset": 3061,
    "end_offset": 3087,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_xiayunzi_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "我们夏云堂的六爻卦，那可是无人能及的",
    "start_offset": 2980,
    "end_offset": 2998,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_bizhuzi_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "一身书生打扮，颇有几分超凡脱俗味道的碧竹子",
    "start_offset": 3166,
    "end_offset": 3187,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_bizhuzi_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "若能进我碧竹堂，势必能爆发出璀璨光彩",
    "start_offset": 3258,
    "end_offset": 3276,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_su_baihua_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "苏百花的百花堂在太初教独树一帜",
    "start_offset": 3436,
    "end_offset": 3451,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_character_su_baihua_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "收女不收男乃是百花堂不成文的规矩，没想到苏百花竟然想破例",
    "start_offset": 3471,
    "end_offset": 3499,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_xianling_tai_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "# 第5章 显灵台上鉴仙眼",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 13,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_location_xianling_tai_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "引路道人将他们带到一个露天的广场",
    "start_offset": 1677,
    "end_offset": 1693,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_faction_taichu_jiao_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "太初教负责最终测试的前辈高人已经恭候多时了",
    "start_offset": 1696,
    "end_offset": 1717,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_faction_taichu_jiao_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "古云堂",
    "start_offset": 2674,
    "end_offset": 2677,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_faction_guyun_tang_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "我们古云堂这一脉一直没有收徒",
    "start_offset": 2672,
    "end_offset": 2686,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_faction_xiayun_tang_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "我们夏云堂的六爻卦，那可是无人能及的",
    "start_offset": 2980,
    "end_offset": 2998,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_faction_bizhu_tang_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "若能进我碧竹堂，势必能爆发出璀璨光彩",
    "start_offset": 3258,
    "end_offset": 3276,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_faction_baihua_tang_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "苏百花的百花堂在太初教独树一帜",
    "start_offset": 3436,
    "end_offset": 3451,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_item_mingjian_xianyan_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "张扬走上测试台，将手放在【明鉴仙眼】上",
    "start_offset": 2293,
    "end_offset": 2312,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_item_mingjian_xianyan_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "随着落叶真人打入一道仙灵之气，【明鉴仙眼】顿时闪起灰色光芒",
    "start_offset": 2316,
    "end_offset": 2345,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_realm_xianmiao_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "等到仙苗期之后，令他投入到我们古云堂一脉如何",
    "start_offset": 2725,
    "end_offset": 2747,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_technique_liuyua_gua_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "在咱们太初教，我们夏云堂的六爻卦，那可是无人能及的",
    "start_offset": 2973,
    "end_offset": 2998,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_xianzhong_grade_system_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "仙种依据强弱分为有色仙种和无色仙种",
    "start_offset": 2021,
    "end_offset": 2038,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_xianzhong_grade_system_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "有色仙种则分为灰、褐、青、橙、赤、金、紫七种颜色",
    "start_offset": 2054,
    "end_offset": 2078,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_xianzhong_grade_system_03",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "修仙者的最终成就并不能以资质好坏盖棺论定，后天努力也能弥补先天不足",
    "start_offset": 2128,
    "end_offset": 2161,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_baihua_tang_recruitment_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "收女不收男乃是百花堂不成文的规矩",
    "start_offset": 3471,
    "end_offset": 3487,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_rule_baihua_tang_recruitment_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "没想到苏百花竟然想破例",
    "start_offset": 3488,
    "end_offset": 3499,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_dormitory_blanket_conflict_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "抢被子的先例一开，冻得瑟瑟发抖的少年们豁然开朗",
    "start_offset": 550,
    "end_offset": 573,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_dormitory_blanket_conflict_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "一拳打在慕容超的脸上",
    "start_offset": 873,
    "end_offset": 883,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_dormitory_blanket_conflict_03",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "从腰间拔出一柄匕首刺向秦浩轩",
    "start_offset": 1147,
    "end_offset": 1161,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_dormitory_blanket_conflict_04",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "然后捡起秦浩轩掉落在地上的被子，塞给秦浩轩",
    "start_offset": 1371,
    "end_offset": 1392,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_zhang_yang_gray_seed_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "【明鉴仙眼】顿时闪起灰色光芒",
    "start_offset": 2331,
    "end_offset": 2345,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_zhang_yang_gray_seed_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "甚至可以成为太初教的新一任掌教",
    "start_offset": 2491,
    "end_offset": 2506,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_four_halls_compete_zhang_yang_01",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "不如黄龙师叔做主，等到仙苗期之后，令他投入到我们古云堂一脉如何",
    "start_offset": 2716,
    "end_offset": 2747,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_four_halls_compete_zhang_yang_02",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "此子同我夏云堂倒是有些师徒缘分",
    "start_offset": 2957,
    "end_offset": 2972,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_four_halls_compete_zhang_yang_03",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "若能进我碧竹堂，势必能爆发出璀璨光彩",
    "start_offset": 3258,
    "end_offset": 3276,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_event_four_halls_compete_zhang_yang_04",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "一定会将这张扬让给我百花堂吧",
    "start_offset": 3417,
    "end_offset": 3431,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_005_001",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "一个身强体健的少年，抢走徐羽被子",
    "start_offset": 205,
    "end_offset": 221,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_005_002",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "他身边那几名权贵子弟",
    "start_offset": 651,
    "end_offset": 661,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_005_003",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "从腰间拔出一柄匕首刺向秦浩轩",
    "start_offset": 1147,
    "end_offset": 1161,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_005_004",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "又脏又硬的大通铺，和潮湿霉臭的薄被子",
    "start_offset": 36,
    "end_offset": 54,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_005_005",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "在昨夜那名引路道人的带领下",
    "start_offset": 1623,
    "end_offset": 1636,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_005_006",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "古云子摇头晃脑，一面从怀中掏出一个白玉瓶",
    "start_offset": 3510,
    "end_offset": 3530,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_005_007",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "五年前那颗饱满仙种的赤明也被你抢走了",
    "start_offset": 3088,
    "end_offset": 3106,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_005_008",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "一连测试了几十个新弟子，然而全都是无色且不饱满的弱种",
    "start_offset": 2181,
    "end_offset": 2207,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_005_009",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "随着落叶真人打入一道仙灵之气",
    "start_offset": 2316,
    "end_offset": 2330,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  },
  {
    "quote_id": "quote_negative_chapter_005_010",
    "chapter_id": "chapter-6790213f5de24a21a00623ee7b467f80",
    "text": "焚香祭天，在仙乐飘渺中",
    "start_offset": 1814,
    "end_offset": 1825,
    "source_hash": "c9113f8033d06608dc77c2f1d2737123c25726453c9dba05769415f8dfb52feb"
  }
]
